# IOUX transfer (this repo)

When changing UI, brand, photos, or marketing:

1. Read [`IOUX_TRANSFER_GUIDE.md`](IOUX_TRANSFER_GUIDE.md) (visual system + construction bible).
2. Then read [`IOUX_TRANSFER_IDENTITY_TASTE.md`](IOUX_TRANSFER_IDENTITY_TASTE.md) (logo, photos, copy — do not rebadge IOUX).

**Keep:** forest/lime/gold, type, pills with nodes, shade stacks, density.  
**Invent:** BigFile mark (lime bars + top-right node), studio photography, product copy.  
**Never:** IOUX U-mark, clinical/warehouse stock, receivables jargon.
